  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Crimson_Shaman.png\" title=\"Crimson Shaman\"><img alt=\"Crimson Shaman\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"250\" src=\"/images/recovered/Crimson_Shaman.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Crimson_Shaman.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Crimson Shaman</div></div></div>\n<p>Whisker Shamans are whisker spellcasters, quite commonly found. They are rather weak and vulnerable.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> Whisker\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Mage\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Whisker Shaman\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Crimson Whisker Shaman\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Tomb of Singe</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Divine Whisker Shaman\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Choppe's Shoppe</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a> L7, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow Library</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> L5,<a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Poison Whisker Shaman\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vergrim's Vexation</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Toxic Shaman\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Widower's Nest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ivory Whisker Shaman\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cave Whisker Shaman\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Clan of the Cave Yetti</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frosty Shaman\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<a name=\"Unique\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Unique</span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Sissirat\" title=\"Sissirat\">Sissirat</a> is the <a href=\"/wiki/Boss\" title=\"Boss\">Boss</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>.  She is a very large and powerful <a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Whisker_Shaman\" title=\"Poison Whisker Shaman\">Poison Whisker Shaman</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
